sequenceDiagram
    %% SD6 - Resell a ticket
    %% Stories: 13, 35, 36, 37, 38, 39, 41, 42, 43, 44, 45
    %% Description: A reseller saves bank account details, uploads a digital ticket from the event page and offers it at a price. The ticket is validated against its event, and a service fee is kept.
    actor RP as Reseller (person)
    participant RS as Reseller
    participant TI as Ticket
    participant EV as Event

    %% covers 45
    RP->>RS: save bank account details
    %% covers 13, 41
    RP->>RS: sell a ticket from the event page
    %% covers 36, 42
    RS->>TI: digital ticket
    %% covers 37, 39
    TI->>EV: event to validate the ticket against
    %% covers 35, 43, 44
    RP->>RS: set price and description
    RS->>TI: ticket for sale
    %% covers 38
    Note over RS,TI: a 3% service fee is deducted from the price
